<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Resources raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Resources raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Thursday it raised its rating for Franklin Resources Inc to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept the company's near-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the San Mateo, Calif., financial services company opened up 2-1/4 at 56.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
